{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban under-18s from independently accessing general-purpose AI chatbots",
        "additional_details": "We call on the Government to prevent under-18s from independently accessing general-purpose AI chatbots, including through browsers without an account. Require robust, privacy-preserving age checks, safeguards against children using adults\u2019 accounts to bypass restrictions, and meaningful enforcement against providers. Regulation must also address risks to children\u2019s mental health, development and independent thinking, and the extra safeguarding burden placed on parents, teachers and schools.",
        "background": "Require stronger child-safety safeguards, independent oversight and accountability from AI companies. Protect children from harmful interactions, while ensuring schools and teachers are not left carrying the burden of managing AI-related risks, mental health consequences and safeguarding concerns.",
